---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
navKey: home
bodyClass: template-homepage
extraStyles:
  - wml-pinned-hero.css
  - wml-mission.css
  - wml-team.css
  - wml-faculty.css
extraScripts:
  - wml-pinned-hero.js
  - wml-mission.js
  - wml-faculty.js
permalink: /index.html
---
<section class="wml-pinned-hero" data-pinned-hero aria-label="Waste Mining Lab research highlights">
  <div class="wml-pinned-hero__media">
    {% if catalog.site.hero_image %}
      <picture>
        <source media="(max-width: 680px)" srcset="{{ catalog.site.hero_image_mobile or catalog.site.hero_image }}">
        <source media="(min-width: 1600px)" srcset="{{ catalog.site.hero_image_large or catalog.site.hero_image }}">
        <img src="{{ catalog.site.hero_image }}" width="1230" height="768" alt="{{ catalog.site.hero_image_alt }}" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
      </picture>
    {% else %}
      <div class="wml-pinned-hero__fallback" role="img" aria-label="Waste Mining Lab hero image has not yet been selected">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 1600 1000" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M-80 920C210 735 276 491 420 120M82 1040C312 768 536 594 804 358M1680 944C1405 737 1312 488 1174 86M1518 1040C1301 756 1085 582 824 340"/><path d="M306 433C167 402 94 305 111 196C236 224 316 319 306 433ZM341 397C358 264 451 187 568 197C541 312 467 379 341 397ZM1267 407C1280 276 1372 199 1490 211C1461 327 1388 392 1267 407ZM1234 379C1101 350 1027 255 1041 147C1165 173 1245 266 1234 379ZM599 656C478 625 409 536 421 436C535 459 608 548 599 656ZM1005 637C1013 526 1088 457 1190 463C1168 563 1104 622 1005 637Z"/></svg>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="wml-pinned-hero__shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wml-pinned-hero__slides" aria-live="off">
    <div class="wml-pinned-hero__slide is-active" data-hero-slide aria-hidden="false"><div class="wml-pinned-hero__slide-inner"><h1 class="wml-pinned-hero__headline">Turning waste into <em>value.</em></h1></div></div>
    <div class="wml-pinned-hero__slide" data-hero-slide aria-hidden="true"><div class="wml-pinned-hero__slide-inner"><p class="wml-pinned-hero__headline">Recovering resources. <em>Restoring balance.</em></p></div></div>
    <div class="wml-pinned-hero__slide" data-hero-slide aria-hidden="true"><div class="wml-pinned-hero__slide-inner"><p class="wml-pinned-hero__headline">Rethinking waste for a <em>sustainable future.</em></p></div></div>
  </div>
  <aside class="wml-faculty-feature" aria-label="Message from the lab director">
    <blockquote class="wml-faculty-feature__quote"><p>“From lab to the field, we reclaim the minerals shaping tomorrow.”</p><cite>— Dr. Asef M. Redwan</cite></blockquote>
    <img class="wml-faculty-feature__photo" src="/assets/images/asef-redwan.png" alt="Dr. Asef M. Redwan" width="240" height="240" decoding="async">
  </aside>
</section>

<section class="mission mission--halftone" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
  <canvas class="mission__canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="mission__inner">
    <p class="mission__eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> ABOUT THE LAB </p>
    <h2 class="mission__title" id="mission-title"><span>Waste is not</span><span>the end of the <em>story.</em></span></h2>
    <p class="mission__description">{{ catalog.site.hero_subtitle }}</p>
    <a class="mission__link" href="/research/">Discover our research <svg viewBox="0 0 28 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 8h24M18 1l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
  </div>
  <button class="mission__motion" type="button" aria-pressed="false" hidden>Pause dot animation</button>
</section>

<div class="wml-people-scene">
  <section class="wml-team" id="team" aria-labelledby="team-title">
    <picture class="wml-team__photo"><img src="/assets/images/team-photo.png" alt="The Waste Mining Lab team gathered outdoors during a site visit." loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture>
    <div class="wml-team__inner">
      <div class="wml-team__heading">
        <h2 id="team-title">Meet the<br><span>TEAM</span></h2>
        <div class="wml-team__introduction">{{ catalog.site.lab_introduction_html | safe }}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="wml-team__stats" aria-label="Waste Mining Lab statistics">
        <div class="wml-team__tile wml-team__tile--members">
          {% if catalog.site.team_member_count != null %}<span class="wml-team__value" data-statistic="team-members">{{ catalog.site.team_member_count }}</span>{% else %}<span class="wml-team__value wml-team__value--text" data-statistic="team-members">Not listed</span>{% endif %}
          <h3>Team Members</h3><p>Meet the people behind the research, led by Dr. Asef M. Redwan.</p>
          <a class="wml-team__button" href="/team/">Learn More <span class="wml-team__sr-only">about our team</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="wml-team__tile" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-labelledby="team-publications">
          <span class="wml-team__value" data-statistic="publications">{{ catalog.publications | filterPublished | length }}</span><h3 id="team-publications">Publications</h3><p>Published research outputs</p><a class="wml-team__tile-link" href="/publications/">View publications</a>
        </div>
        <div class="wml-team__tile" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-labelledby="team-research-areas">
          <span class="wml-team__value" data-statistic="research-areas">{{ catalog.researchAreas | filterPublished | length }}</span><h3 id="team-research-areas">Research Areas</h3><p>Configured research focus areas</p><a class="wml-team__tile-link" href="/research/">Explore research</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="wml-faculty" aria-labelledby="faculty-title" data-faculty>
    <div class="wml-faculty__inner">
      <div class="wml-faculty__copy">
        <p class="wml-faculty__eyebrow">MEET THE LAB DIRECTOR</p>
        <h2 id="faculty-title">Meet Dr. Asef<br><em>M. Redwan.</em></h2>
        <div class="wml-faculty__affiliations"><p>Assistant Professor of Civil &amp; Environmental Engineering<br><strong>North South University</strong></p><p>Joint Appointee &amp; Affiliate Faculty<br>Idaho State University, USA</p></div>
        <div class="wml-faculty__biography"><p>At the intersection of environmental engineering, microbiology, and resource recovery, Dr. Asef M. Redwan explores how research can turn complex environmental challenges into practical solutions.</p><p>He earned his PhD in Environmental Engineering at Texas Tech University and brings research experience from Idaho National Laboratory. His work examines the biogeochemistry of interactions between metals and microorganisms, with applications in bioremediation and the recovery of valuable resources.</p><p>Through his academic roles in Bangladesh and the United States, he connects this scientific foundation to sustainable water systems and environmental technologies—working toward cleaner water and more thoughtful use of what we discard.</p></div>
        <div class="wml-faculty__actions"><a class="wml-faculty__primary" href="{{ catalog.site.director_profile_url }}">View Profile</a><a href="{{ catalog.site.director_linkedin_url }}">LinkedIn</a><a href="mailto:{{ catalog.site.director_email }}">Email</a></div>
      </div>
      <picture class="wml-faculty__portrait"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/asef-redwan-640.webp 640w, /assets/images/asef-redwan-1080.webp 1080w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 48vw"><img src="/assets/images/asef-redwan-transparent-bg.png" width="1080" height="1080" alt="Dr. Asef M. Redwan speaking to students in a classroom." loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
